      "writtenOn": "2017-09-25T13:00:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t know if that could break things. If we want to postpone cleanup until it actually dies, we could put it on the transaction stack as if everything were ok, and return -EFAULT after that. Then binder_thread_release() would send the failed reply. Do you think that is a better solution?",
